import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="隐私政策" titleEn="Privacy">
  <div class="container page-hero"><div class="eyebrow" data-zh="隐私">Privacy</div><h1 data-zh="尽可能少地收集。">Data, with restraint.</h1><p class="lead" data-zh="以下为产品隐私政策草案，正式上线前需经营者审核确认。">Draft privacy policy. The operator must review and approve it before public launch.</p></div>
  <article class="container legal"><h2 data-zh="我们处理什么">What we process</h2><p data-zh="邮箱用于账户验证和密码重置；生成余额与消费流水由服务端记录。生成回复时，当前 X 帖子内容及链接、你提供的风格、写作样本及最多 20 条最近选择的回复会经平台后端发送至 DeepSeek 处理。">Your email supports account verification and password reset. Credits and usage are stored server-side. To generate a draft, the current X post and its link, your style and writing samples, and up to 20 recently selected replies are sent to DeepSeek through our backend.</p><h2 data-zh="我们不收集什么">What we avoid</h2><p data-zh="不收集 X Cookie，不自动发布评论，不长期存储完整原帖或回复正文。旧版本本地保存的个人 Key 在风格迁移后会被移除。">We do not collect your X cookies or post replies for you. Full post and reply text is not retained long-term. An older personal key is removed from extension storage after style migration.</p><h2 data-zh="保留与删除">Retention and deletion</h2><p data-zh="验证码短时有效；生成结果的安全重试有效期为 10 分钟，过期正文通过定时任务清理；已完成的 AI 请求元数据按 30 天策略清理；额度流水与订单在账户存续期间保留。账户删除与数据请求渠道待正式上线前确认。">Codes expire quickly. Generated output can be replayed safely for 10 minutes; expired text is removed by scheduled cleanup. Completed AI request metadata is cleaned up under a 30-day policy. Credit ledger and orders are kept for the account lifetime. Account deletion and data request channels require review before launch.</p><p class="notice" data-zh="草案：本页尚未经过经营者或法律专业人士最终审核。">Draft: this page has not received final operator or legal review.</p></article>
</Base>
